# Check every text file out with LF line endings, on every platform.
#
# Git for Windows converts line endings to CRLF on checkout unless told
# otherwise. The expected output under testdata then ends its lines with a
# carriage return the program never prints, and gofmt reports every Go file as
# unformatted, so a fresh clone on Windows fails its tests before anything has
# been changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
